<title>UK: Rabobank sets 500 mln Danish crown six-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 500 mln Danish crown six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK AUSTRALIA LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  RABOBANK NETHERLANDS RATED AAA/AAA</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.825   PAY DATE   L16.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875 PCT REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK/NE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
